        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2004/30, 30\" Contemporary Nobe Bathroom Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana BBN2004/30 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. At 30\", it is large enough to hang multiple towels at once. It has a  polished chrome finish. This Nobe series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2004_30.gif?v=1704354505\" width=\"600\" height=\"143\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2004/30 30\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-12-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2003-12\"><b>12\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-18-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2002-18\"><b>18\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-24-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2003-24\"><b>24\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the BBN Nobe Solid Brass 30 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2004_30.pdf?v=1691095364\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2004_30 30\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
